WEBVTT

1
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:14,820
One inch of field, one inch of wall

2
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:16,750
They underestimated the damage of iron rods

3
00:00:16,750 --> 00:00:18,150
Can't you move?

4
00:00:18,150 --> 00:00:19,750
Hide a stick and come back again

5
00:00:19,750 --> 00:00:20,750
Hide your ass

6
00:00:20,750 --> 00:00:22,550
That iron rod was swung around like Wang Baquan.

7
00:00:22,550 --> 00:00:28,460
I can't even touch my brother with my hands.

8
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:30,660
How do you use your hands to respond to an iron rod? Do you practice family skills?

9
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:31,860
i am a doctor

10
00:00:31,860 --> 00:00:33,460
I was iced to death at that time

11
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,060
It's all based on my memory of being a surgeon before.

12
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:36,860
Blindly stabbed the opponent's heart

13
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:38,850
I used to use a scalpel to save people

14
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:40,450
Now use it to kill people

15
00:00:41,370 --> 00:00:42,770
Congratulations on surviving

16
00:00:42,770 --> 00:00:44,570
Each person handed over a bottle of Qingmei Su

17
00:00:44,570 --> 00:00:45,970
Let’s find Uncle Zhao’s territorial meat.

18
00:00:46,170 --> 00:00:47,420
Come on friends

19
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:48,820
I’ve baked it for you a long time ago

20
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:56,830
So fragrant
